    "id": "CF-2639500D0O000000rwimUAA",
    "title": "NGO Guardian and Enquiries Management System",
    "description": "This is a Contract Award Notice.\r\n\r\nThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) on behalf of National Guardian Office (NGO) requires a new enquiries/case management solution (based on MS Dynamics 365) to fulfil four main business functions:\r\n1. Log and Process Day to day Enquiries Management\r\n2. Provide Guardians Registration Portal\r\n3. Upload Registered Guardians Details to NGO Website\r\n4. Anonymised Data Sets\r\n\r\nThis procurement was undertaken through the CCS Software Design and Implementation Services Agreement (RM6193), following the Further Competition process.\r\n\r\nThe Contract is awarded for a total period of 96 months. \r\n\r\nTotal Awarded Value is maximum of all charges including all optional contract extensions.         \r\n\r\nContract Reference: CQC NGO 018",
